  --- acio-cpu3 (role=ACIO3) ---
      gate  341 name='CIO3_RECONFIG-V'        VIRTUAL (no PS reg, flags.on=False)
    gate posture: gate 341: VIRTUAL(on=False)
    -> acio-cpu3: NO ACTIVE gate -> ASC block un-clocked; NOT reading MMIO (would AXI-stall/wedge m1n1). IOP not booted.
  (All ACIO gates VIRTUAL/OFF -> the IOP that owns the CIO3-PLL/phy_ip PHY is un-clocked and un-booted -> booting it requires powering its gate first, which the AP may not own. If a gate ever reads ACTIVE and the IOP is STOPPED/RUN=0 -> boot it via ASC(u, base).boot() before pcie_init.)
